    "public_api_change": "ADDITIVE",
    "schema_diff_summary": "In edit_binding, add the arm ctrl-s that returns Some(Command::Save). Place it beside the existing cmd-s arm. Leave cmd-s, f5, ctrl-space, ctrl-], and ctrl-[ as they are. The modifier order stays ctrl, alt, shift, cmd. normalize_binding already maps control-s to ctrl-s. The test ctrl_s_saves asserts that ctrl-s and control-s return Command::Save and that cmd-s still returns Command::Save. Branch from the current tip of main. base_sha records that tip at planning time. If main has moved, use the new tip. Keep this change under about 60 lines."
